(text "MAF connector (GX12-7): separate analog and frequency pins; the harness uses the one that matches the MAF." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ec00a814-9ce5-4328-bd80-2d1a64e91553))
(text "Bosch 0280218335 is analog 0-5 V, harness ID 1.0 k. JP2 adds a 5 V pull-up for open-collector frequency MAFs." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a4f92060-579d-4a15-92e1-ad8678ebaf89))
